{"meta":{"id":"security-issue","category":"it/server/infra/security","title":"보안 이슈","subtitle":"","summary":"서버 운영 시 발생한 보안 문제와 조치","tags":["보안","서버","운영"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"blog: code/back/SecureIssue.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-07-02"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>SECURITY</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-07-02</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">보안 이슈</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 서버 운영 시 발생한 보안 문제와 조치</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">작업 코드를 오픈해야되나 말아야되나 고민이 됐는데</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">어차피 중요한 데이터도 없고 특별한 보안 기능을 구현한 것도 아니라 그냥 오픈했습니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">저렇게 접근을 하는 사람이 있다는 게 신기하고 흥미진진하네요.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">(진짜 빡세게 해킹당하면, 골치 아프겠지만... 안되면 노트북 포맷하고 다시 설정해야겠지만,)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">아... 적으면서도 이게 맞나싶긴한데 어차피 보안 정도가 높은 건아니니깐</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그냥 몸으로 겪으면서 개선을... ㅋㅋㅋ</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">1. php 해킹 방식</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">접근 : /api/vendor/phpunit/phpunit/src/Util/PHP/eval-stdin.php</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><a href=\"https://support.alertlogic.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005711043-PHPUnit-eval-stdin-php-Unauthenticated-RCE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-indigo-700 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2\">PHPUnit eval-stdin.php 인증되지 않은 RCE</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">agant 값을 활용해서 보안 작업 진행</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">//express : Middleware 처리\r\nconst pathCk = (path) =&gt;{ // /.형태 있으면 true\r\n    let bCk = /\\/\\./.test(path);\r\n    return bCk;\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction isAllowedUserAgent(req) {\r\n  const ua = req.headers[&#x27;user-agent&#x27;] || &#x27;&#x27;;\r\n  return ua.toLowerCase().includes(&#x27;curl&#x27;) || ua.toLowerCase().includes(&#x27;badbot&#x27;) ;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nfunction hackingCK(req , agent){\r\n//true면, 해킹\r\n        if(isAllowedUserAgent(req)){\r\n            return `curl : ${req.headers[&#x27;user-agent&#x27;]}`;\r\n        }\r\n        else if(pathCk(req.path)){\r\n            return `/. : ${req.path} `;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    return null;\r\n}</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">2. api/.env 접근</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">( 1번 보고 추가 조치해둬서 접근 X )</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">+ nginx 에서 추가 조치</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">//nginx.conf\r\nlocation ~ /\\. {\r\n        deny all;\r\n        return 404;\r\n}</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">접근방식</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">접근 방식 (1) : 터미널로 접근시 일부 해더값을 제거해서 보낼 수 있다.</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">//터미널 접근\r\n//추가 헤더를 제거한다. ( curl이 기본적으로 붙여 보내는 헤더는 유지 )\r\ncurl -H &quot;&quot; https://xxxxx/api/.env\r\n//특정 해데 제거\r\ncurl -H &quot;User-Agent:&quot; https://xxxxx\r\ncurl -H &quot;Accept:&quot; https://xxxxx\r\n//복수 헤더 제거\r\ncurl \\\r\n    -H &quot;User-Agent:&quot; \\\r\n    -H &quot;Accept:&quot; \\\r\n    https://xxxxx\r\n\r\n//--connect-to = 가상 바인딩\r\n//--connect-to 호스트A:포트A:호스트B:포트B\r\n// 호스트A:포트A에 대한 연결을 가로채서 호스트B:포트B 에 TCP 연결\r\n// URL 호스트는 변경되지 않음 → Host 헤더·SNI 에 그대로 반영\r\ncurl --connect-to example.com:443:1.2.3.4:443 https://example.com/</pre></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">하나씩 작업 진행 예정</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">1. DNS 스푸핑 (DNS Spoofing)</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">2. ARP 기반 중간자 공격 (ARP MitM)</p>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 mb-1.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-bold text-stone-900\">3. BGP 하이재킹 (BGP Hijacking)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/security/security-issue","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"security","title":"SSL · 보안","path":"it/server/infra/security"}],"hasImage":false}